-19fb21d47d50" :question/math-academy-id "q-104447" :question/is-example false :question/problem "For the functions $f(x)$ and $g(x),$ you're given the following data:\n\n$$\nf(-7)=2\\sqrt{3},\\,{f}^{′}(-7)=\\sqrt{3},\\,g(-7)=5\\sqrt{3}\\,{g}^{′}(-7)=-4\\sqrt{3}\n$$\n\nCompute $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(f(x)g(x))$ at $x=-7.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the product rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(f(x)g(x))=f(x){g}^{′}(x)+g(x){f}^{′}(x).\n$$\n\nAt the point where $x=-7,$ this gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(f(x)g(x))|}_{x=-7} & =f(-7){g}^{′}(-7)+g(-7){f}^{′}(-7) \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{3}\\cdot (-4\\sqrt{3})+5\\sqrt{3}\\cdot \\sqrt{3} \\\\  & =-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-104447/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2f08b8fa-6f05-5c10-b2d7-5d35e6c48e74"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104447"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-48835/selection/2372eaf10d3e3c6104c5a2d85d5b9909ce1a56c36600fa4c17241dbcaf0762b2" :answer/id #uuid "53a54f0f-91c1-56f1-8a1b-049bb004eac8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{e}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48835/selection/d1334c45e7c70c1f4ad9b6ae7172d3ce4d30a01c47cddf7483238d60acf646d5" :answer/id #uuid "057ff728-0a72-5294-9350-08c0f00f4d6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{e}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48835/selection/30658d088d5b87ec1a64410993944d89cb17d534d10aadc650826eb087f134fe" :answer/id #uuid "0573b694-1a10-5eb0-853f-da31d3d2ce6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{e}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48835/selection/de65f68b9ebe8220ad685ae8fd317e4e85f600952fac99fcca3864668321a3a0" :answer/id #uuid "e402acff-f8ae-558b-979b-659d9ac5c98d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48835/selection/2a28a53216361474017108aa9cf0fffd0fb392524d53aeb00b78355e4fa703c6" :answer/id #uuid "20f12f06-79e0-5747-af5a-7bdc846bae94" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2e" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48835/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8765e35f-5939-5d58-957d-9d0d711eb610" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-48835/selection/de65f68b9ebe8220ad685ae8fd317e4e85f600952fac99fcca3864668321a3a0" :answer-field/choices ["q-48835/selection/2372eaf10d3e3c6104c5a2d85d5b9909ce1a56c36600fa4c17241dbcaf0762b2" "q-48835/selection/d1334c45e7c70c1f4ad9b6ae7172d3ce4d30a01c47cddf7483238d60acf646d5" "q-48835/selection/30658d088d5b87ec1a64410993944d89cb17d534d10aadc650826eb087f134fe" "q-48835/selection/de65f68b9ebe8220ad685ae8fd317e4e85f600952fac99fcca3864668321a3a0" "q-48835/selection/2a28a53216361474017108aa9cf0fffd0fb392524d53aeb00b78355e4fa703c6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-48835" :question/id #uuid "8309ca21-d36c-57be-afb2-430137fc5049" :question/math-academy-id "q-48835" :question/is-example false :question/problem "For the function $f(x)$ and $g(x)$, you're given the following data:\n\n$$\nf(e)=1,\\,{f}^{′}(e)=\\frac{1}{e},\\,g(e)={e}^{2},\\,{g}^{′}(e)=2e\n$$\n\nCompute $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(f(x)g(x))$ at $x=e.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the product rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(f(x)g(x)) & =f(x){g}^{′}(x)+g(x){f}^{′}(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt the point where $x=e$, this gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(f(x)g(x))|}_{x=e} & =f(e){g}^{′}(e)+g(e){f}^{′}(e) \\\\  & =1\\cdot 2e+{e}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{e} \\\\  & =3e.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-48835/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2f08b8fa-6f05-5c10-b2d7-5d35e6c48e74"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-48835"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-104446/sel